1. Definitions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Licensor" means Nick Wentz.

"Software" means everything in this repository and every build made from it:
source code, data files, maps, dialogue and story text, characters, ASCII art,
portraits, documentation, and compiled executables or web builds.

"Game" means a compiled, playable build of the Software.

"Mod" means original material you create that changes, extends or adds to the
Game (for example new maps, dialogue, balance changes, or a patch).

"Commercial" means intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or
monetary compensation, including selling, charging for access, paywalls,
advertising revenue tied to the thing itself, or bundling with something sold.

