3. Permission: personal study and education
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You may, free of charge and for non-Commercial purposes only:

  a. read the Software, and build and run it on your own devices, to learn
     from it;
  b. use it in teaching and learning (for example classes, workshops, study
