You may not distribute builds of the Software or substantial portions of it
under this section.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Permission: mods
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You may create Mods and share them publicly, free of charge, provided that:

  a. using the Mod requires a legitimately obtained copy of the Game;
  b. the Mod does not include the Game's executables or web builds, and does
     not include substantial portions of the Software (your own original
     content, patch/diff files, and the minimum excerpts of data files needed
     for the Mod to work are fine);
  c. the Mod is not sold or otherwise used Commercially (voluntary donations
     to the Mod's author are fine);
  d. the Mod is clearly labelled as unofficial and not endorsed by the
     Licensor; and
  e. you remove or stop distributing a Mod if the Licensor asks you to.

The Licensor may, at their discretion, include or adapt ideas from Mods in the
Game without obligation to you.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4A. Permission: videos, streams and screenshots
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you obtained the Game legitimately, you may stream it, record and publish
videos of it (including reviews and let's-plays), and post screenshots, and you
may monetise that content (ads, sponsorships, subscriptions, donations). This
permission does not cover distributing the Game itself.

